### Backend Service (Session & Terminal)

#### [MODIFY] [session.service.js](file:///c:/Users/het70/Desktop/latesteditor/backend/src/services/session.service.js)
-   **Enforce Non-Root UID Mapping:** Update the Docker container configuration to explicitly set a fallback `User` string (e.g., `1000:1000`) when valid, non-root system UIDs are not present (specifically on Windows and when started as Root).
-   **Add Security Options:** Inject `SecurityOpt: ["no-new-privileges"]` strictly into the `HostConfig` dictionary.

#### [MODIFY] [terminal.ws.js](file:///c:/Users/het70/Desktop/latesteditor/backend/src/ws/terminal.ws.js)
-   **Explicit User Specification in Exec:** Retrieve the safe User mapping string and apply it explicitly within the `container.exec({ ... User: safeUserString })` call to ensure the active terminal interactive shell is absolutely capped at non-root execution.

